<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="light">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Admin | Infoboxes | {{siteName}}</title>
    {{>partials/head-deps.hbs}}
    {{>partials/head-styles.hbs}}
</head>
<body>
{{>partials/admin-shell.hbs}}
    <div class="page-meta"><h1><i class="mdi mdi-card-text-outline" aria-hidden="true"></i> Infoboxes</h1><div class="d-flex gap-2"><a class="btn btn-outline-secondary" href="/a/infoboxes/usage"><i class="mdi mdi-clipboard-list-outline" aria-hidden="true"></i> Usage report</a><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/a/infoboxes/new">New template</a></div></div>
    {{#otherSite}}<div class="alert alert-warning" role="alert"><i class="mdi mdi-information-outline" aria-hidden="true"></i> That template belongs to a different site. Showing <strong>{{managedSiteName}}</strong>'s templates instead.</div>{{/otherSite}}
    <p>An infobox is a way to standardize the appearance and provision of specific information across a set of pages. A
    <strong>template</strong> is a named set of fields that define the requested information. A <strong>rule</strong>
    suggests this template to pages by path or tag; editors then fill in the values on the Page Info tab of matching
    pages. Give a field help text and its label picks up a dotted underline on the page, which readers can
    hover or tap for an explanation of what it means.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Templates</h2>
    {{#hasTemplates}}
    <table class="table table-hover align-middle">
        <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Slug</th><th>Fields</th><th></th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        {{#templates}}
        <tr>
            <td>{{name}}</td>
            <td><code>{{slug}}</code></td>
            <td>{{fieldCount}}</td>
            <td><a class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" href="/a/infoboxes/{{id}}/edit">Edit</a></td>
        </tr>
        {{/templates}}
        </tbody>
    </table>
    {{/hasTemplates}}
    {{^hasTemplates}}<p class="text-secondary">No templates yet. <a href="/a/infoboxes/new">Create one</a> to get started.</p>{{/hasTemplates}}

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Rules</h2>
    <p class="text-secondary">A rule determines how a page is selected for an infobox in one of two ways: <strong>path</strong>: an exact path (<code>/example/test</code>), <code>example/test/*</code> (direct children in this path), or <code>example/test/**</code> (all descendants); or <strong>tag</strong> (Page Info has tag added). A page may match more than one rule for one or more infoboxes. Infobox data is always optional; without, viewers will see no infobox, and editors will see note encouraging them to fill out infobox data.</p>
    {{#hasRules}}
    <table class="table table-hover align-middle">
        <thead><tr><th>Match by</th><th>Pattern</th><th>Template</th><th></th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        {{#rules}}
        <tr>
            <td>{{#isTag}}<i class="mdi mdi-tag-outline" aria-hidden="true"></i> Tag{{/isTag}}{{^isTag}}<i class="mdi mdi-file-tree" aria-hidden="true"></i> Path{{/isTag}}</td>
            <td><code>{{pattern}}</code></td>
            <td>{{templateName}}</td>
            <td>
                <form method="post" action="/a/infoboxes/rules/{{id}}/delete" class="m-0" onsubmit="return confirm('Delete this rule? Pages it matched keep their stored data but stop showing the infobox.');">
                    {{{csrfField}}}
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger">Delete</button>
                </form>
            </td>
        </tr>
        {{/rules}}
        </tbody>
    </table>
    {{/hasRules}}
    {{^hasRules}}<p class="text-secondary">No rules yet.</p>{{/hasRules}}

    {{#hasTemplateOptions}}
    <form method="post" action="/a/infoboxes/rules" class="edit-form row g-2 align-items-end">
        {{{csrfField}}}
        <div class="col-auto">
            <label for="matchType" class="form-label">Match by</label>
            <select class="form-select" name="matchType" id="matchType">
                <option value="PATH">Path</option>
                <option value="TAG">Tag</option>
            </select>
        </div>
        <div class="col">
            <label for="pattern" class="form-label">Pattern</label>
            <input class="form-control" type="text" name="pattern" placeholder="e.g. apps/** or a tag like integration" required id="pattern">
        </div>
        <div class="col">
            <label for="templateId" class="form-label">Template</label>
            <select class="form-select" name="templateId" required id="templateId">
                {{#templateOptions}}<option value="{{id}}">{{name}}</option>{{/templateOptions}}
            </select>
        </div>
        <div class="col-auto">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Add rule</button>
        </div>
    </form>
    {{/hasTemplateOptions}}
{{>partials/admin-shell-end.hbs}}
{{{bodyHtml}}}</body>
</html>
